<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Commercial Bankshares EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Commercial Bankshares EPS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Josephthal Lyon &amp; Ross analyst Frank Barkocy said he raised his 1996 earnings estimate on Commercial Bankshares Inc to $1.12 per share from $1.05 and raised the 1997 estimate to $1.35 from $1.25</p>
<p>-- Target price raised to $18/shr from $16-17 range</p>
<p>-- Analyst says stock of Miami-based bank holding company is rated strong buy on fundamentals and takeover potential</p>
</text>
